      "content": "idk i just feel like i can handle this myself. i've used old eye drops before and it was fine. if i just take maybe one or two drops of the antibiotic stuff to kill any bacteria from the soap, won't that basically be the same thing as a doctor's treatment? it seems way safer than just ignoring the irritation and hoping it goes away. it's just a tiny bit of soap, it's not like i'm blind or anything. can't i just try the drops first and see if it helps?",
